[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0010","text":"——真乃酱"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0020","text":"你努力了吗？\n成为偶像的时候"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0030","text":"……欸…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0040","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0050","text":"────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0060","text":"……成为偶像的时候，有没有努力过我不太清楚……但是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0070","text":"之前的万圣节演唱会，我很开心\n能让观众们高兴"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0080","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0090","text":"所以……现在……\n从今往后，我想更加努力……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0100","text":"喂——，樋口——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0110","text":"一起看吗？\n电影"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0120","text":"……那个与其说是电影\n不如说是自然纪录片吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0130","text":"我就算了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0132","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0140","text":"……樋口——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0150","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0160","text":"樋口，是偶像吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0170","text":"天知道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0180","text":"谁知道呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0190","text":"从所属关系上来说，算是吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0200","text":"啊——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0210","text":"那你说，你努力了吗？\n成为偶像的时候"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0220","text":"没什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0230","text":"没努力啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0240","text":"只是被星探发掘了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0250","text":"听说你是直接冲进事务所的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0260","text":"那不算努力"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0270","text":"这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0280","text":"……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0290","text":"那你说————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0300","text":"你从刚才开始一直在问什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0310","text":"……开心吗？\n能让观众高兴的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0320","text":"……话说回来，你还没有过那种经历吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0330","text":"没有吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0340","text":"你有吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0350","text":"……嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0360","text":"那，如果——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0370","text":"能让观众高兴的话，\n你会想要努力吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0380","text":"……………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0390","text":"那有点让人不爽\n感觉像是中了那个人的圈套一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0400","text":"呵呵"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0410","text":"樋口，很讨厌吧\n制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0420","text":"为什么？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0430","text":"什么都能"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0440","text":"……这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0450","text":"但是，你不想知道吗？\n努力的前方，有什么在等着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0460","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0470","text":"你想知道吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0480","text":"诶？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0490","text":"浅仓你呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0500","text":"啊——……怎么说呢\n你觉得呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0510","text":"樋口应该更了解我吧\n关于我的事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0520","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0521","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0530","text":"……就算不努力，\n鲸鱼也知道该怎么游泳"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0540","text":"……嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0550","text":"但是，飞行的方式，\n不努力是不会知道的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0560","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0570","text":"那也就是说，\n能飞起来吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0580","text":"鲸鱼也是，只要努力的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0590","text":"天知道"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0561","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0562","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04020000_06_0600","text":"试试看不就好了？"}]
